    "quote": "Algorithm~\\ref{alg:AAE} has expected regret bounded as $$\\bm{R_T}\\leq 32\\cdot\\ln(2kT/\\delta)\\cdot\\log(T)\\underset{I\\in\\mathcal{I}(G)}\\max\\sum_{a\\in I}\\frac{1}{\\Delta(a)}+T\\delta +1$$ Setting $\\delta=\\frac{1}{T}$, we obtain a bound of $\\bm{R_T}=\\tilde{O}(\\sum_{a\\in I}\\frac{1}{\\Delta(a)})$ for some Independent Set $I$ of the underlying graph."
